  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MAGICSWORDSMAN-MAGIC_SWORDSMAN_CHARACTER.0-1r.ancient": "무덤지기여. 검은 잠들지 않는다. 다음 무덤을 기다릴 뿐이지. 바로 너를.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.MAGICSWORDSMAN-MAGIC_SWORDSMAN_CHARACTER.0-attack": "Both",
  "NEOW.talk.MAGICSWORDSMAN-MAGIC_SWORDSMAN_CHARACTER.0-0.ancient": "...또 칼을 잔뜩 짊어진 아이가 왔구나.",
  "NEOW.talk.MAGICSWORDSMAN-MAGIC_SWORDSMAN_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "계속",
