  "NEOW.talk.MAGICSWORDSMAN-MAGIC_SWORDSMAN_CHARACTER.1-1.char": "미안. 내가 달래 볼게.",
  "NEOW.talk.MAGICSWORDSMAN-MAGIC_SWORDSMAN_CHARACTER.2-0.ancient": "몇 번을 쓰러져도 돌아오는구나, 간수야.",
  "NEOW.talk.MAGICSWORDSMAN-MAGIC_SWORDSMAN_CHARACTER.2-0.next": "계속",
  "NEOW.talk.MAGICSWORDSMAN-MAGIC_SWORDSMAN_CHARACTER.2-1.char": "검들이 아직 밖에 있으니까.",
